# Discipline pages moved from /capabilities/* to /disciplines/* — perm-
# redirect the old paths so previously indexed links and inbound links
# land on the current page instead of the SPA fallback.
/capabilities/*    /disciplines/:splat    301

# S01: the catch-all `/* /index.html 200` fallback was REMOVED.
#
# It made every unknown URL (/this-page-does-not-exist, /help/guides) return
# HTTP 200 with the full homepage, which is duplicate content for search
# engines and hides broken links. Without it, Cloudflare Pages serves the
# prerendered static file for a known route, and 404.html with a real
# HTTP 404 for anything unknown.
#
# Every real route is prerendered to its own index.html by
# scripts/prerender.mjs, so direct loads and refreshes still work:
#   /                      dist/index.html
#   /disciplines/<id>      dist/disciplines/<id>/index.html
#   /imprint               dist/imprint/index.html
#   /cookies               dist/cookies/index.html
#   /help                  dist/help/index.html